FILE     fb30i.nc (from line 1)
DIALECT  series 0i 30i (Macro B at line 2, POW/ADP/ATAN[a,b]/ATAN[x]/MOD at line 2, AND/OR of conditions at line 5)
L2     SET    #1 = 225.
L3     SET    #2 = 1024.
L4     SET    #3 = 2.
L5     JUMP   GOTO 10 -> line 7
L7     SET    #5 = 135.
L8     NC     M30
END    M30
NOTE     -w FILE writes the DX32 program (features/FB2DX.md)
RESULT   ok
